dialect protocol
protocol stdio.pdf.1.7.diff
version 1
schema stdio.pdf.1.7.diff
start diff
framing record

# 🔺️ Derive-owned binary diff frame (`../../🦀️.rs` `🔖️DiffCodec`): the shared op `format`
# byte, then the container-less pack record body of the same sparse `PdfDiff` value the text
# facet prints. The value's lanes (page, resource, navigation, document and retained COS
# collections) are all typed fields of that one record; `flags` are not needed because every
# lane is an optional field of the walked value rather than a separately framed segment.
field format u8
chain diff bytes
